# IliaGPT - Environment Variables

## Required Variables

```bash
# Database (REQUIRED)
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/dbname

# Session (REQUIRED)
SESSION_SECRET=your-secret-key-min-32-chars

# Base URL
BASE_URL=http://localhost:5000
```

## LLM Providers (at least one required for chat)

```bash
# xAI (Grok) - Recommended primary
XAI_API_KEY=xai-...

# Google Gemini - Recommended fallback
GEMINI_API_KEY=AIza...

# OpenAI (optional)
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# Anthropic (optional)
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
```

## Authentication

```bash
# Google OAuth
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=...apps.googleusercontent.com
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=GOCSPX-...

# Microsoft OAuth (optional)
MICROSOFT_CLIENT_ID=
MICROSOFT_CLIENT_SECRET=
MICROSOFT_TENANT_ID=

# Auth0 (optional)
AUTH0_DOMAIN=
AUTH0_CLIENT_ID=
AUTH0_CLIENT_SECRET=
```

## Email (optional)

```bash
# Resend
RESEND_API_KEY=re_...

# SMTP (alternative)
EMAIL_SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
EMAIL_SMTP_PORT=587
EMAIL_SMTP_USER=
EMAIL_SMTP_PASS=
EMAIL_FROM=noreply@example.com
```

## Admin

```bash
# Used for admin access + billing support emails
ADMIN_EMAIL=carrerajorge874@gmail.com
# Recommended: >= 12 chars (required: >= 8 chars)
ADMIN_PASSWORD=secure-password-min-12-chars

# Required in production when OAuth is enabled (encrypts stored OAuth tokens)
TOKEN_ENCRYPTION_KEY=replace-with-32+chars-random-string

# Optional hardening
ADMIN_REQUIRE_2FA=false
```

## Seed/Bootstrap Flags (dangerous)

```bash
# Enable seeding on server start (production seeds always run; in development use this flag)
SEED_ON_START=false

# Hide and disable catalog seed endpoints unless explicitly enabled
ALLOW_CATALOG_SEEDING=false

# Hide and disable Stripe product seeding unless explicitly enabled
ALLOW_STRIPE_PRODUCT_SEEDING=false
```

## Database Pool

```bash
DB_POOL_MAX=20
DB_POOL_MIN=2
```

## Optional Services

```bash
# Twilio for SMS
TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=
TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=
TWILIO_PHONE_NUMBER=

# Stripe for payments
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_...
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_...

# Redis for caching (optional, falls back to memory)
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379
```

## Development

```bash
NODE_ENV=development
PORT=5000
DEBUG=true
LOG_LEVEL=debug
```

## Production

```bash
NODE_ENV=production
PORT=5001
LOG_LEVEL=info
```

## Notes

1. **LLM Keys**: At least one of XAI_API_KEY, GEMINI_API_KEY, or OPENAI_API_KEY is required for chat functionality.
2. **Database**: PostgreSQL is required. The app will fail to start without DATABASE_URL.
3. **Session**: SESSION_SECRET should be a random string of at least 32 characters.
4. **OAuth**: Google OAuth requires authorized redirect URI: `https://yourdomain.com/api/auth/google/callback`
